# Development and testing dependencies.
#
# Pulls in the runtime set so requirements-dev.txt is self-contained: one
# `pip install -r requirements-dev.txt` gives a complete dev environment, and
# the two lock files cannot drift apart because both compile from
# requirements.in.
#
# Production installs requirements.txt only, so none of this ships to servers.
-r requirements.in

